     "path": "chief-of-staff/leadership-meeting-and-escalations.md",
     "title": "Leadership meeting and escalation triage",
     "summary": "Templates for a decision-shaped leadership agenda and decision item, plus a triage table for escalations, blockers and decision cards that land on the Chief of Staff.",
